
                       geant4-11-02-ref-00
                       ===================

Major development/fixes included since the last development tag are:

 o Updated particle properties to PDG-2023.
 o Added new G4SafetyCalculator class, auxiliary to G4Navigator; used in
   G4Navigator in ComputeSafety() to avoid saving/restoring state.
 o Improvements on the QSS Stepper: the main QSS integration loop is
   interrupted when the number of substeps exceeds a predefined threshold.
 o Added new physics constructor for neutrino physics and its messenger.
 o Fixed possible incorrect calculatioon of effective charge of a material
   in G4EmSaturation.
 o Added classes for QMD model optimised for light ions.
 o In G4RadioactiveDecay, changed default threshold for the time beyond
   which radioactive decays are ignored, from twice the age of the
   Universe to one year.
 o New advanced example "dsbandrepair", a Geant4-DNA application for
   evaluating the early radiation-induced DNA damage.
 o New extended example "radiobiology", realized for dosimetric and
   radiobiological applications of  proton and ion beams.
   
---------- Reference-tag 'Release Notes' -----------

(o)  Fixes included in patch release 11.1.3

